#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/index.md:10
msgid "Public C API"
msgstr "公共 API 参考"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/index.md:12
msgid ""
"Declarations and contracts below come from the maintained public C headers "
"through Doxygen and Breathe. Vendor implementations and private provider "
"state are excluded. Exact-profile composition headers explicitly identify "
"their supplier-layout requirements; Native controls remain host-test "
"interfaces."
msgstr ""
"以下声明和合同由维护中的公共 C 头文件经 Doxygen 和 Breathe 生成，不包含厂商实现及 provider "
"私有状态。精确配置的装配头文件会显式说明厂商布局要求；Native 控制接口仅用于主机测试。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/index.md:17
msgid ""
"Select the exact part, Board, backend and mode from the current support "
"reference. A public header or optional method does not authorize every "
"provider, board connection or hardware mode."
msgstr "从当前支持参考中选择精确料号、板卡、后端和模式。公共头文件或可选方法不表示所有 provider、板级连接或硬件模式均已获准。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/index.md:21
msgid ""
"Factory lookup returns an existing immutable face without starting hardware."
" Controllers, child endpoints and optional faces retain their declared "
"identities. Accepted requests and buffers stay borrowed until acquire-"
"observed SETTLED; cancellation, deadlines and DMA completion do not revoke "
"the borrow. Applications own execution progress, waiting, policy and joined "
"shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Factory 查找返回已有不可变接口，不启动硬件。控制器、子端点及可选接口保持其声明的身份。已接受的请求和缓冲区在以 acquire 语义观测到 "
"SETTLED 前持续借用；取消、截止时间及 DMA 完成均不撤销借用。应用负责执行推进、等待、策略及完成 join 的停机。"

